result: Implemented and deployed bounded safe error categories at the managed gateway, structured unknown-tool errors, and Upskill operation enums (31f163d). Live reported add operation now gives invalid_tool_arguments and allowed choices; files preview remains dry_run/applied=false/base_mutated=false; invalid source gives upstream_tool_error. Private exception text remains masked. Proxy 1339 tests, 100% line+branch coverage; lint/format/docs checks pass. Evidence in docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md.
